their names are Frieda

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:10.790
Chelsea, Ceaser and Lao Slimeslaw.

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:15.170
By the way it's a matter of minutes

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:16.520
