00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.650
This is the thing to do
if you're in Cologne.

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:22.693
Is ride on the cable car.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:30.298
I think that's why most
teenagers here shoot themselves

00:03:30.298 --> 00:03:31.140
