00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:34.300
The city of Cologne is a medieval city.

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:36.590
It's been around for a long time.

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:41.350
The initial name for
the city wasn't Cologne,

00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:43.226
