00:03:43.226 --> 00:03:44.320
(audience laughing)

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.988
But they changed it

00:03:45.988 --> 00:03:47.527
and they didn't think
it had a nice (mumbles).

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:51.060
This is the Cologne Cathedral.

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:53.523
It's the world's largest Gothic cathedral.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:59.480
It's 750 years old, and it
is absolutely breathtaking.

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:04.883
